                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 19,
                            "last_played": 1512807449
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have no idea where these positive reviews are coming from. If, like me, you find yourself watching the video and are thinking, \"cool, I dig the aesthetic but what's the actual gameplay look like?\" that's where you and I got confused. That is the gameplay. You're looking at it. You click on random rooms that appear and then you click on the monsters to shoot them.\n\nThat's it. That's all there is.\n\nMaybe this would be interesting on a phone? Well, \"interesting\" is maybe a bit generous, but, you know... viable, I guess, is a better word. This isn't even a game. This isn't anything you \"play.\" Avoid.",
